  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1726053315175453}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 333
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 再看云秋兰那边，数位同门已然随之前往，在阵眼之地旁布下了一个小型的防御阵法。而一旦哪里屏障薄弱了，负责机动的数位同门则会飞速前往，施法加固。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
