  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1726053315175453}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 281
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 但显然妖兽也明白自己的处境。就在此时此刻，推山兽正在四处出击，试图发起总攻，包围、突袭我们各后山驻地。我已下令正阳山各部低阶修士撤回所属阵地固守避战，兽潮被逼至此处只是时间问题。
